## 2. The core decision

The product should support hosted gateway / VPS Agent Computer, but do it in stages.

Do not build the final encrypted cloud session vault first. That is heavy, legally sensitive, and easy to mess up.

Start with:

```text
Hosted Gateway MVP = gateway-local persistent volume
```

Then move to:

```text
Hosted encrypted backup
```

Then maybe:

```text
Cloud session vault and migration/failover
```

The MVP should say honestly:

```text
Your hosted Agent Computer keeps your channel session on its encrypted persistent volume.
If the gateway restarts, it should reconnect.
If the volume is destroyed, you may need to reconnect.
If no gateway is running, live replies are paused.
```

No fake “100% secure” nonsense. Nobody serious believes that, except maybe people selling crypto wallets out of a van.

