## 12. Cost strategy

### 12.1 1GB VPS

Use only for:

```text
lightweight Telegram gateway
simple websocket heartbeat
small channel connector
queue relay
basic server-safe actions
```

Do not use for:

```text
browser automation
Chrome/Playwright
multiple users
WhatsApp plus heavy runtime
local LLMs
large vector DB
many concurrent agents
```

### 12.2 Practical sizing

```text
1GB RAM:
  one low-volume Telegram gateway only

2GB RAM:
  minimum practical hosted Agent Computer MVP

4GB RAM:
  WhatsApp, browser-lite, more stable gateway

8GB+ RAM:
  serious business/customer-support gateway with browser/computer-use
```

### 12.3 Cost model

For pilots, paying for users is acceptable if it proves value.

Use:

```text
company-provided hosted gateway for first pilot users
one dedicated container/volume per workspace
Telegram-first
worker sleeps when idle
gateway always-on only for paying/pilot users
manual cost monitoring
```

Do not build autoscaling magic before users.

### 12.4 Billing idea

Plans can include:

```text
Personal: local gateway only or limited on-demand hosted gateway
Pro: hosted Telegram gateway with monthly runtime cap
Business: always-on hosted gateway + Telegram + business connectors
Business Plus: dedicated WhatsApp gateway/container
Enterprise: managed dedicated Agent Computer / private deployment / BYOK
```

